Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.35,0:00:43.27,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0030,0035)}{\frz1.378\pos(544,460)}A{\fntangak}lchemistry
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.55,1:12:15.57,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(112,112)}{\pos(792,526)}D{\fs55}y{\fs}w
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.35,0:00:43.27,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0030, 0035)}{\pos(792,526)}D{\fs55}y{\fs}w
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.39,0:02:49.39,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator and editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.39,0:02:51.39,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistants:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Martini, gaarysn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.39,0:02:53.39,nicks,,0,0,0,,Typesetter translators: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee, Zero_Amamiya
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.34,0:01:06.39,memories,,0,0,0,,Yul from the So family
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.10,0:01:09.68,memories,,0,0,0,,Don’t come back here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.06,0:01:17.48,memories,,0,0,0,,You will come again -
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.90,0:01:20.53,memories,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.99,0:01:26.82,memories,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.85,0:01:55.69,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I couldn't stop her
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.10,0:01:58.94,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,I couldn’t ask why
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.19,0:02:03.44,voiceover,,0,0,0,,When she cut my sincerity into pieces,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.86,0:02:07.53,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,I stopped cherishing our memories
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.82,0:02:11.45,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Everything became a secret that I had to keep in my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.79,0:02:21.21,general text,,0,0,0,,You got up early. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.51,0:02:26.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.80,0:02:29.26,general text,,0,0,0,,came here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.01,0:02:34.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Catch the bird. I'll prepare it for you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.23,0:02:38.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Food doesn’t bring me joy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.81,0:02:40.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I will cook rice with chestnuts
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.90,0:02:44.15,general text,,0,0,0,,The chestnuts here are very sweet
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.03,0:02:50.82,general text,,0,0,0,,There are very sweet chestnuts in Danhyangk
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:05.46,general text,,0,0,0,,And I don’t like sweets either
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.80,0:03:11.01,general text,,0,0,0,,You could just refuse
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.09,0:03:13.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Given your strength, I could have died
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:17.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t overact
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.39,0:03:21.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I pushed you, but I didn’t intend to kill you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.81,0:03:23.40,general text,,0,0,0,,But they pushed
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.02,0:03:25.94,general text,,0,0,0,,No need to bother with breakfast
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.03,0:03:27.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll leave when Dan Gu wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.57,0:03:30.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t want it, as you want
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.76,0:03:48.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.01,0:03:51.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll eat before leaving
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.84,0:03:52.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Cook some food
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.01,0:03:54.64,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought you didn’t want
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.22,0:03:57.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t say that. Don't slander
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.23,0:04:04.56,general text,,0,0,0,,You drank too much yesterday, I thought you would feel bad in the morning
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.65,0:04:07.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I refused so as not to bother you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.28,0:04:09.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Understood
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.28,0:04:11.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Then
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.53,0:04:14.12,general text,,0,0,0,,- we need to wash more rice\N- Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.78,0:04:17.49,general text,,0,0,0,,- I'll wash\N- Have you cooked rice before?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.58,0:04:20.87,general text,,0,0,0,,No, but I can if you teach me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.00,0:04:23.42,general text,,0,0,0,,It's very simple
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:27.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Rinse the rice in water, add enough water
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.63,0:04:29.09,general text,,0,0,0,,and cook over high heat
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.92,0:04:32.09,general text,,0,0,0,,And then let it stand
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:35.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Quite simple
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.85,0:04:46.31,general text,,0,0,0,,You said you could if I explained
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.40,0:04:48.11,general text,,0,0,0,,They themselves said it was easy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.65,0:04:52.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I was wrong. I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.49,0:04:55.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Look at this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.03,0:04:57.62,general text,,0,0,0,,He burned all over
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.41,0:05:00.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Let me make amends
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.08,0:05:03.62,general text,,0,0,0,,And those vegetables
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.71,0:05:05.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Teach how to cut vegetables
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:12.72,general text,,0,0,0,,- Just throw it away now\N- Wow
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.60,0:05:20.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Dan Gu
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.06,0:05:22.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:25.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Swim before leaving
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.27,0:05:27.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Mineral water will make your skin softer
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.23,0:05:28.82,general text,,0,0,0,,And have breakfast
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.90,0:05:30.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.32,0:05:32.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Deok and Yul prepare breakfast together
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.36,0:05:34.74,general text,,0,0,0,,- Together?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.82,0:05:37.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul cooks rice with Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.54,0:05:53.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I told you to cut the onion into large pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.18,0:05:59.26,general text,,0,0,0,,- Are these large?\N- No
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.93,0:06:02.47,general text,,0,0,0,,You don’t know the meaning of the word “large”?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.56,0:06:04.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Large pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.56,0:06:08.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Large...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.36,0:06:09.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Not the same
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.73,0:06:11.44,general text,,0,0,0,,These are also small
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.19,0:06:14.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Like this
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.82,0:06:18.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Large pieces. Like this
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.32,0:06:22.29,general text,,0,0,0,,I should have explained it properly
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.37,0:06:25.29,general text,,0,0,0,,How was I supposed to understand your “large pieces”?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.37,0:06:27.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought you were the best magician of Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.79,0:06:31.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Can’t tell big from small?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.46,0:06:33.38,italics,,0,0,0,,Forget
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.46,0:06:35.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Pour water in a bowl
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.72,0:06:44.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.48,0:06:47.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Which bowl are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.48,0:06:50.48,general text,,0,0,0,,This one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.03,0:06:55.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Or this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.82,0:06:56.70,general text,,0,0,0,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.45,0:07:00.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.91,0:07:09.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Why does it seem like Moo Deok is scolding him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.63,0:07:12.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you sure she likes him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.17,0:07:13.63,general text,,0,0,0,,This is this type of girl
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.13,0:07:17.84,general text,,0,0,0,,She does not show affection or embarrassment in front of others
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.14,0:07:24.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Just look at Yulia
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.10,0:07:27.81,general text,,0,0,0,,They scold him, but he still studies
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.60,0:07:32.31,general text,,0,0,0,,- Studying?\N- Look
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:34.82,general text,,0,0,0,,I said that’s enough
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.19,0:07:37.65,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t like salty food
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.28,0:07:42.66,italics,,0,0,0,,He was never like that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.74,0:07:45.66,general text,,0,0,0,,- Try it yourself\N- {\i1}Even in front of Master Ho or my uncle
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.74,0:07:46.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Funny
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.54,0:07:50.46,italics,,0,0,0,,He's like a scared student, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.54,0:07:51.92,italics,,0,0,0,,Bland, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:55.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Here. I should have stopped when I said
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.84,0:07:59.26,general text,,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry\N- {\i1}Dear master and his obedient student
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.38,0:08:02.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Leave. Need to finish cooking
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.76,0:08:04.89,general text,,0,0,0,,- Master and disciple?\N{\i1}- Sit down
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.97,0:08:07.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you so stubborn,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.35,0:08:09.48,general text,,0,0,0,,if you’re cooking for the first time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.65,0:08:17.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:21.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's see how you taught him, and how you learned
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.86,0:08:23.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's try
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.79,0:08:30.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Tasty
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.16,0:08:31.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Tasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:36.09,general text,,0,0,0,,I did everything as Moo Deok said
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.13,0:08:40.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Well done
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.34,0:08:44.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Delighted, I guess, after the teacher’s praise
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.72,0:08:48.01,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought I was good at everything because people call me a genius
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.81,0:08:50.98,general text,,0,0,0,,But it turns out there is something I can’t do
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.06,0:08:52.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.10,0:08:53.73,general text,,0,0,0,,thank you for helping me realize this
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.81,0:08:57.98,general text,,0,0,0,,It was not easy because he did not understand what I was saying
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.07,0:09:00.74,general text,,0,0,0,,But he still continued to try
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.40,0:09:03.07,general text,,0,0,0,,So I continued to teach him
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.61,0:09:05.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Exaggerating
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.62,0:09:08.91,general text,,0,0,0,,As if the royal table had been set here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.99,0:09:11.79,general text,,0,0,0,,You can learn a lot while cooking
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.87,0:09:13.46,general text,,0,0,0,,- You should learn too\N- Alas,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.54,0:09:16.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t have a teacher like him
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.17,0:09:20.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but the rice is a little burnt
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.26,0:09:22.92,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes\N{\i1}- You can try again
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.01,0:09:26.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, do you think he’ll do better next time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.55,0:09:29.10,general text,,0,0,0,,He's not completely hopeless
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.18,0:09:30.85,italics,,0,0,0,,Thank you for those words
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.82,0:09:47.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Why do you wash it yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.32,0:09:49.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Ask your amazing student to help
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.53,0:09:53.25,general text,,0,0,0,,He cooked food, so I'll clean everything up
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.62,0:09:56.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Was it pleasant to teach him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.83,0:09:58.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want him
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.71,0:09:59.79,general text,,0,0,0,,was your student?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:01.88,general text,,0,0,0,,It would be easier if it were like this
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:04.55,general text,,0,0,0,,He is diligent, obedient
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.34,0:10:07.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Not lazy and reckless like you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.59,0:10:10.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher, don’t cheat on me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.68,0:10:12.52,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.60,0:10:14.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I understand that you like his diligence and perseverance
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.98,0:10:17.31,general text,,0,0,0,,But I am your only student
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.40,0:10:20.86,general text,,0,0,0,,A teacher should not have several students and vice versa
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.94,0:10:24.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Upset because I taught Yulia to cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.24,0:10:26.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. Exactly. How could you teach someone else
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.24,0:10:28.28,general text,,0,0,0,,when your student was right in front of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.87,0:10:31.03,italics,,0,0,0,,Do you want to teach someone how to cook? Let it be me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.12,0:10:32.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Teaching someone else is betrayal and treason
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.87,0:10:36.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I understand the part about betrayal
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.62,0:10:37.83,general text,,0,0,0,,But betrayal?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.92,0:10:39.38,general text,,0,0,0,,No words
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.42,0:10:43.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.51,0:10:46.47,general text,,0,0,0,,that I felt betrayed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.81,0:10:55.02,general text,,0,0,0,,What else is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.06,0:10:56.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.06,0:10:58.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, don’t cheat on me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.90,0:11:00.31,general text,,0,0,0,,This hurts and angers me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.40,0:11:03.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t know that my student was so obsessed
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.90,0:11:05.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, you will be the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.86,0:11:08.95,general text,,0,0,0,,a student who says nonsense in the morning. Are you satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.03,0:11:10.66,general text,,0,0,0,,- But...\N{\i1}- Mu Dok!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.70,0:11:12.66,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.29,0:11:15.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Host,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.91,0:11:19.58,general text,,0,0,0,,it is treason if I call others masters
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.21,0:11:21.54,general text,,0,0,0,,and answer their call?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.63,0:11:23.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Nothing can be done here, of course
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.46,0:11:25.96,general text,,0,0,0,,But when you call them,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.05,0:11:28.47,general text,,0,0,0,,call me masters
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.26,0:11:31.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Laughter and nothing more
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.97,0:11:37.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Pak, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.68,0:11:40.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, you hurt my feelings. I told you to call me master!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:51.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Very high
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.16,0:11:55.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul, did you want to see this tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.95,0:11:58.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Sort of
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.62,0:12:01.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe it exists
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:12.76,memories,,0,0,0,,How did you know that I was hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.47,0:12:16.26,memories,,0,0,0,,There is a tall tree nearby,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.02,0:12:21.39,memories,,0,0,0,,all of Danhyangok is visible from the top
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.86,0:12:29.78,general text,,0,0,0,,The whole of Danhyangok is visible from the top
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:35.24,general text,,0,0,0,,So you climbed
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.41,0:12:37.66,general text,,0,0,0,,to the very top?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:44.63,general text,,0,0,0,,I assumed so, since it is high
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.50,0:12:48.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to go up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.76,0:12:50.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Help you climb?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.09,0:12:53.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Dan Gu, you can't climb it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.80,0:12:57.14,general text,,0,0,0,,You need to at least master Chisa in order to climb there
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.39,0:12:59.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.02,0:13:01.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should try?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.10,0:13:03.10,italics,,0,0,0,,Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.19,0:13:05.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe you can do it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.69,0:13:06.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, let's go with him
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.69,0:13:11.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to climb?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:18.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.45,0:13:21.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to climb this tree with just anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.50,0:13:27.34,general text,,0,0,0,,"With just anyone"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.51,0:13:33.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I think she's too afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.80,0:13:35.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.52,0:13:48.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I studied the core of his energy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.77,0:13:52.57,general text,,0,0,0,,He was a commoner, not a magician
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.57,0:13:56.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m sure there are many more victims
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.82,0:14:00.20,general text,,0,0,0,,There is a nomad among us
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.79,0:14:02.70,general text,,0,0,0,,What to do, Master Li?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.79,0:14:05.62,general text,,0,0,0,,It is more difficult to recognize the origin of this magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.71,0:14:07.21,general text,,0,0,0,,how to catch a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:09.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I suspect Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.42,0:14:14.42,general text,,0,0,0,,This nomad who invaded Sosnovy Bor,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.34,0:14:17.30,general text,,0,0,0,,there were astrologers there
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.26,0:14:21.06,general text,,0,0,0,,In addition, it is Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.14,0:14:23.02,general text,,0,0,0,,destroyed Nak Su during the soul transfer,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.81,0:14:25.73,general text,,0,0,0,,and then all her people
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.19,0:14:28.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.86,0:14:38.62,general text,,0,0,0,,We found out who he was
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.70,0:14:39.82,general text,,0,0,0,,And who?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.91,0:14:42.29,general text,,0,0,0,,One of Jeonbugwan's servants
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.37,0:14:45.83,general text,,0,0,0,,What? Jeonbugwan is involved again
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.91,0:14:48.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll go see Jin Mu right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.67,0:14:50.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone is behind me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.34,0:14:51.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Yom
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.21,0:14:53.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.84,0:14:54.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Do nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.84,0:14:59.97,general text,,0,0,0,,At one time, your recklessness ruined a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.05,0:15:02.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Now you have grown up, but your character is still the same
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.06,0:15:04.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry, teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.31,0:15:06.43,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s not time yet
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.52,0:15:10.48,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to keep a close eye on Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.56,0:15:11.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.86,0:15:14.40,general text,,0,0,0,,You grew up smart
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.69,0:15:17.82,general text,,0,0,0,,You were running around in your underpants
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.90,0:15:21.16,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe that you grew up like that and lead people
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.95,0:15:27.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.29,0:15:34.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.38,0:15:37.59,general text,,0,0,0,,He was a student
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.13,0:15:41.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Master So Kyung, founder of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.60,0:15:44.06,general text,,0,0,0,,But he is so young
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.18,0:15:46.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Not at all
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.39,0:15:49.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I still remember singing
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.35,0:15:53.19,general text,,0,0,0,,at the celebration of his centenary
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.86,0:15:58.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I even danced
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.07,0:16:04.95,general text,,0,0,0,,This dog... is it Gwigu?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:11.62,general text,,0,0,0,,So you took Gwiga from Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.63,0:16:14.96,general text,,0,0,0,,He will find a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.75,0:16:18.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su died during the soul transfer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.30,0:16:19.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.22,0:16:22.68,general text,,0,0,0,,She was a famous mercenary and a talented magician
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.05,0:16:27.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Isn’t it her soul that I felt?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.99,0:16:42.45,general text,,0,0,0,,The Sword of Chang Gan now
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.53,0:16:44.70,general text,,0,0,0,,- his son, right?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.78,0:16:48.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you met him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.70,0:16:50.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw a young man with a bracelet
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.66,0:16:53.83,general text,,0,0,0,,and the maid who followed him
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.59,0:16:56.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Interesting
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.97,0:17:06.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok collected some chestnuts
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:09.22,general text,,0,0,0,,They are sweet, yes. Give Kim the maid some too
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.31,0:17:10.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.19,0:17:20.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you take your father’s sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.36,0:17:23.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Oh, this? Moo Deok took it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.70,0:17:26.78,general text,,0,0,0,,You’re not going to train, why did you bring it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.53,0:17:28.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Take it to the maid Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.83,0:17:31.70,memories italics,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.75,0:17:34.04,memories,,0,0,0,,not a son
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:36.54,memories,,0,0,0,,Chan Gan
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.05,0:17:41.17,general text,,0,0,0,,As you wish
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:46.55,general text,,0,0,0,,- Let's go\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.26,0:17:51.89,general text,,0,0,0,,You said that you often collected herbs here
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.23,0:17:57.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you seen anyone who lived here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.19,0:18:00.19,general text,,0,0,0,,No. Who would even live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.57,0:18:02.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.53,0:18:08.74,general text,,0,0,0,,And more
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.79,0:18:12.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Is it very cold in winter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.37,0:18:15.79,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.92,0:18:19.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I have never been here in winter
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.67,0:18:24.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Worried every time the snow fell
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.47,0:18:28.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Worried whether it was too cold
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.85,0:18:32.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Is everything okay
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.40,0:18:44.11,general text,,0,0,0,,It gets warmer here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.19,0:18:47.20,general text,,0,0,0,,than it may seem
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.28,0:18:53.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Snow melts quickly in sunny places
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:18:58.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes? I'm glad
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.30,0:19:06.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, there is plenty of food here even in winter
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.68,0:19:10.34,general text,,0,0,0,,There is a place to hide from the snow
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.22,0:19:15.60,general text,,0,0,0,,- I’m sure it’s delicious\N- Very
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.56,0:19:19.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Should we stay another day?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.40,0:19:23.90,italics,,0,0,0,,Apparently Moo Deok really likes him
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.45,0:19:30.20,general text,,0,0,0,,He told her
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.32,0:19:32.66,general text,,0,0,0,,don’t like it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:35.24,general text,,0,0,0,,I say you like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.95,0:19:36.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.95,0:19:41.04,general text,,0,0,0,,She doesn’t look at us the way she looks at him
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.51,0:19:51.18,general text,,0,0,0,,The wind blows
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.85,0:20:01.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Is it coming from her?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.32,0:20:06.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Dan Gu, let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.90,0:20:07.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.28,0:20:14.03,italics,,0,0,0,,Bye, Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.50,0:20:20.54,italics,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.92,0:20:29.47,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll show them off
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.23,0:20:44.40,general text,,0,0,0,,- Have a nice trip\N- See you later
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.31,0:20:47.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Try to remember where you lost the spirit amulet
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.11,0:20:50.19,general text,,0,0,0,,- Okay\N- And keep your head down
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.70,0:20:52.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Because of you, even the Unified Council was convened
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.95,0:20:55.87,general text,,0,0,0,,I think all 12 of my former teachers were there
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.95,0:20:58.79,general text,,0,0,0,,They were all so heartless towards you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.45,0:21:02.33,general text,,0,0,0,,They even offered to seal all your energy
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.08,0:21:05.33,general text,,0,0,0,,- Why would they say that?\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.84,0:21:09.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Because you ran away from the fight
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.26,0:21:13.05,italics,,0,0,0,,But this is just stupid
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.13,0:21:14.97,general text,,0,0,0,,You didn’t want it to happen either
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.05,0:21:17.26,italics,,0,0,0,,Nobody expects you to show up
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.35,0:21:21.02,general text,,0,0,0,,So just stay here and live quietly
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.39,0:21:25.10,italics,,0,0,0,,The head wanted to know something
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.65,0:21:28.73,general text,,0,0,0,,He asked if you were doing what you were told
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.99,0:21:31.99,memories italics,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.49,0:21:35.53,memories,,0,0,0,,the fruit of your mother's betrayal
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.61,0:21:38.16,memories,,0,0,0,,But we can’t let you become the head of Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.24,0:21:41.41,memories,,0,0,0,,So stop dreaming of following in the footsteps
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.54,0:21:45.75,memories,,0,0,0,,of his father
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.33,0:21:48.38,memories,,0,0,0,,Remain a clueless heir
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.75,0:21:52.47,memories,,0,0,0,,Chan family
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.84,0:21:58.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Can I give him a positive answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.26,0:22:00.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Have I ever been obedient?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.81,0:22:03.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell him I'm doing the exact opposite, being reckless
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.94,0:22:08.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Dan Gu, leave the sword here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.11,0:22:10.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.90,0:22:13.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to help Mu Deok catch a pheasant
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:18.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Bye
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.29,0:22:26.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Did we hurt his pride?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.96,0:22:27.83,italics,,0,0,0,,Leave him
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.92,0:22:30.42,general text,,0,0,0,,We cannot ask him to return and die with dignity there
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.39,0:22:40.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you returning with the sword that you gave away?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.27,0:22:45.27,general text,,0,0,0,,I have become a laughing stock and it hurts my pride
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.39,0:22:50.15,general text,,0,0,0,,In that case, let's train as if our lives depend on it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.48,0:22:52.61,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems that you are amused by,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.32,0:22:56.11,general text,,0,0,0,,that your student has become a laughing stock
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.90,0:22:59.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Moreover, I will add
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.57,0:23:03.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Your friends didn’t ask you to come home with them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.95,0:23:06.71,general text,,0,0,0,,If they were you, they would fight to the death
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.79,0:23:09.71,general text,,0,0,0,,And you were told to run and hide
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.79,0:23:11.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.38,0:23:16.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Because you are useless
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.88,0:23:20.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Your tongue is sharper than a sword
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.72,0:23:24.72,general text,,0,0,0,,So words hurt. Ruthlessly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.81,0:23:27.06,general text,,0,0,0,,I would not hesitate to stab you with a sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.14,0:23:29.14,general text,,0,0,0,,if that would get you back on track
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.23,0:23:30.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, master
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.35,0:23:32.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Beat your useless student to death
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.32,0:23:37.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Why didn’t you perk up after my words?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.44,0:23:38.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Why so broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.24,0:23:43.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Your evil words upset me in the end
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.20,0:23:45.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I need to take a bath and relax
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.45,0:23:49.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Why does he bathe so often?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.50,0:23:51.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Worthless and lazy idiot
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:52.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope you boil in boiling water!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.79,0:23:57.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Incredible! What kind of teacher says that to his student?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.47,0:24:06.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk doesn’t remember how he lost his spirit amulet?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.60,0:24:09.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe someone sold it after Uk dropped it
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.81,0:24:12.06,general text,,0,0,0,,So the amulet got to them
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.15,0:24:14.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard there is a place where they sell such amulets
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.32,0:24:18.11,general text,,0,0,0,,In that case, try to find out everything
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.28,0:24:20.57,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.65,0:24:21.91,general text,,0,0,0,,How...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.03,0:24:26.33,general text,,0,0,0,,is Uka doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.95,0:24:31.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything is fine with him, he is fed and healthy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.58,0:24:34.71,general text,,0,0,0,,He still hasn’t gotten rid of the bracelet
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.05,0:24:38.13,general text,,0,0,0,,You can go
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.40,0:25:00.86,general text,,0,0,0,,It's not so heavy anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.95,0:25:02.49,general text,,0,0,0,,And it doesn’t interfere with walking
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.57,0:25:05.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Some magicians train with iron weights,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.24,0:25:07.28,general text,,0,0,0,,to strengthen your hands and wield a sword better
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.79,0:25:10.96,italics,,0,0,0,,You unknowingly became stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.04,0:25:13.25,general text,,0,0,0,,while wearing this heavy bracelet all day long
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.33,0:25:14.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Unintentional,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.83,0:25:17.13,general text,,0,0,0,,but you found a great training tool for yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.42,0:25:19.96,general text,,0,0,0,,You are incredibly lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.05,0:25:23.43,general text,,0,0,0,,If I take it off, I'll be faster and stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.01,0:25:27.47,general text,,0,0,0,,But if you don’t learn to control yourself, you will become even more pathetic
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.22,0:25:30.27,general text,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.93,0:25:31.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Forget
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.85,0:25:38.94,general text,,0,0,0,,What were you and Yul talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.36,0:25:42.86,general text,,0,0,0,,About Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.86,0:25:47.87,general text,,0,0,0,,He asked how it was here in winter
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.04,0:25:53.91,italics,,0,0,0,,You met Naxu,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.67,0:25:56.33,general text,,0,0,0,,when you were young?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.29,0:26:01.34,general text,,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure when I saw her body
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.42,0:26:03.97,general text,,0,0,0,,But a trip to Danhyangk helped me confirm this
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.05,0:26:05.13,general text,,0,0,0,,So I’m only saying this now
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.22,0:26:10.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Danhyangok - a deep and dangerous valley
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.10,0:26:12.77,general text,,0,0,0,,The little girl could not have survived there without someone's help
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.85,0:26:15.56,general text,,0,0,0,,She lived there, as if hiding from someone
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.98,0:26:19.36,italics,,0,0,0,,When she found out who I was and what family I was from,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.11,0:26:22.03,italics,,0,0,0,,I never saw her again
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.24,0:26:25.70,italics,,0,0,0,,So I found out your name...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.49,0:26:29.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell everything you know about her
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.37,0:26:33.75,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know anything
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.37,0:26:36.12,general text,,0,0,0,,No name, no age
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.79,0:26:38.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Except for the cliff where we watched the birds...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.75,0:26:40.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I never saw where she lives
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.55,0:26:45.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Only one
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.43,0:26:50.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Once she mentioned her father
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.40,0:27:05.15,memories,,0,0,0,,My father described the stars
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.07,0:27:09.49,italics,,0,0,0,,Then I didn’t pay attention to it
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.57,0:27:12.20,general text,,0,0,0,,But this is what stargazers do
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.28,0:27:13.87,general text,,0,0,0,,from Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.25,0:27:16.37,italics,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.87,0:27:18.92,general text,,0,0,0,,among stargazer magicians
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.00,0:27:21.92,general text,,0,0,0,,was someone angry with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.92,0:27:26.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Stargazer
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.55,0:27:28.88,general text,,0,0,0,,from Jeonbugwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.89,0:27:31.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Mage?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.81,0:27:40.48,italics,,0,0,0,,Twenty years ago there was an astrologer who died...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.11,0:27:43.82,italics,,0,0,0,,at the hands of four families
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.69,0:27:48.99,general text,,0,0,0,,His entire family was killed that day
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.66,0:27:51.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Except for one person
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.16,0:27:53.95,general text,,0,0,0,,His daughter was not found that night
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.35,0:28:22.23,italics,,0,0,0,,It turns out that our family was guilty
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.19,0:28:25.11,general text,,0,0,0,,in the death of her father
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.69,0:28:27.40,general text,,0,0,0,,She must have had a grudge against you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.48,0:28:29.82,general text,,0,0,0,,since your family took part in this
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.90,0:28:32.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you remember anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.41,0:28:35.08,general text,,0,0,0,,It was so long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.12,0:28:37.83,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s unlikely that I can remember anything else
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.81,0:29:02.52,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Because I wanted to see them
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.81,0:29:06.02,memories italics,,0,0,0,,The broken leg didn’t bother me
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.11,0:29:07.90,memories italics,,0,0,0,,And I was not afraid that they would scold me
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.32,0:29:14.16,memories,,0,0,0,,I loved them very much
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.37,0:29:27.50,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I saw you use this to call your bird
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.42,0:29:30.67,memories,,0,0,0,,I want to try it too
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.67,0:29:33.59,memories,,0,0,0,,Can I have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.48,0:30:31.11,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,The Crown Prince is strong
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.73,0:30:36.15,voiceover,,0,0,0,,There is only one way for Uka to defeat him and stay alive
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.07,0:30:38.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Tansu
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.48,0:31:14.23,general text,,0,0,0,,What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.94,0:31:17.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Cut the water drops while they fall
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.28,0:31:20.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Not raindrops
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.66,0:31:23.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Even someone as unlucky as you
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.12,0:31:25.58,general text,,0,0,0,,will be able to cut the drops that drip so slowly
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.25,0:31:27.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Forward
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.44,0:31:50.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Just three drops in one sitting
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.19,0:31:52.36,italics,,0,0,0,,Doesn’t matter
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.44,0:31:55.98,general text,,0,0,0,,The dance you will learn requires you to cut only one
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.07,0:31:57.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Tansu?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.74,0:31:59.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.41,0:32:03.91,general text,,0,0,0,,I understand, I’m a pretty fast learner,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.99,0:32:05.33,general text,,0,0,0,,but Tansu... not too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.41,0:32:08.00,general text,,0,0,0,,It looks like your teachers taught you something
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.08,0:32:09.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Correct
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.16,0:32:11.96,general text,,0,0,0,,You can learn Tansu only after mastering Chisu
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.63,0:32:14.59,general text,,0,0,0,,You have barely mastered Ryusu
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.67,0:32:17.30,general text,,0,0,0,,You still don’t control your energy
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.38,0:32:19.22,general text,,0,0,0,,A student of your level cannot learn this
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.55,0:32:21.68,general text,,0,0,0,,But?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.30,0:32:23.64,general text,,0,0,0,,But only this way
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.31,0:32:29.60,general text,,0,0,0,,you will defeat the crown prince and stay alive
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.09,0:33:07.18,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Tansu is the movement of energy with a sword
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.26,0:33:09.06,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Your right hand was weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.77,0:33:12.35,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,but strengthened thanks to the bracelet
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.48,0:33:14.35,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Only one drop
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.44,0:33:18.44,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Hit one drop so that you can collect and direct energy
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.79,0:33:32.54,general text,,0,0,0,,You won’t be able to master Tansu that quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.21,0:33:34.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's eat and continue
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.84,0:34:24.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Tansu?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.80,0:34:26.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, he will never be able to master it
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.30,0:34:32.14,italics,,0,0,0,,This is not a maid and her master
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.85,0:34:34.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Hurry teacher and student
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.16,0:36:15.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.41,0:36:19.58,italics,,0,0,0,,So you're training him
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.63,0:36:24.50,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw him practicing Tansu
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.38,0:36:26.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Where did you learn this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.17,0:36:31.18,general text,,0,0,0,,The owner is smart, he had 12 teachers
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.26,0:36:33.30,general text,,0,0,0,,He is trying to run without really learning to walk
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.39,0:36:35.51,general text,,0,0,0,,He has a long way to go
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.60,0:36:37.85,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s at least worth a try
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.43,0:36:41.14,general text,,0,0,0,,His next step could lead to his death
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.15,0:36:47.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Does your master know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.73,0:37:24.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Why didn’t you dodge?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.81,0:37:25.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Seriously
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.75,0:37:44.00,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the result of you releasing energy outward
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.17,0:37:47.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Your arm might burst if you continue
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.38,0:37:56.72,general text,,0,0,0,,She is about to begin to rot. Then you'll have to cut it off
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.39,0:37:58.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.68,0:38:05.77,general text,,0,0,0,,If decayed energy spreads throughout your body,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.40,0:38:07.65,general text,,0,0,0,,you will die
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.38,0:38:29.63,general text,,0,0,0,,The heat has subsided. Are you okay
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.71,0:38:31.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Sleep. Sleep is the best medicine
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.13,0:38:33.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Liar
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.30,0:38:37.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Is it true what he said?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.64,0:38:39.47,italics,,0,0,0,,It doesn’t matter if I die from poison,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.55,0:38:42.35,general text,,0,0,0,,flogging, blow with a sword or from having your arm burst
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.06,0:38:46.44,general text,,0,0,0,,My teacher doesn’t care about his student
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.02,0:38:49.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Correct
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.36,0:38:54.36,general text,,0,0,0,,This is because you are very lucky and lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.11,0:38:57.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Is lying your middle name?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.62,0:39:02.70,general text,,0,0,0,,I just don’t want to scare you
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.29,0:39:06.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it. Thank you my merciless teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.54,0:39:09.13,general text,,0,0,0,,But stay away when I hold the sword again
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.21,0:39:10.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I almost stabbed you today
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.88,0:39:14.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I stood because I wanted you to control the energy yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.88,0:39:16.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t mean to interfere
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.26,0:39:19.01,general text,,0,0,0,,You didn’t interfere. I was just worried about you
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.64,0:39:27.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Think of me as a mother bird who is worried...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.77,0:39:29.81,general text,,0,0,0,,that her eggs will break. Can you imagine?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.90,0:39:32.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Doesn’t matter. This would hardly harm me
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.52,0:39:33.65,general text,,0,0,0,,I could dodge
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.40,0:39:35.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Wasn’t dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.69,0:39:37.90,general text,,0,0,0,,How could you dodge if I was so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.99,0:39:39.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Not so fast
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.32,0:39:41.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Scoundrel...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.54,0:39:45.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Quick, right? Don't dodge
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.20,0:39:46.70,general text,,0,0,0,,You attacked without warning!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.79,0:39:48.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes? Then here
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.62,0:39:49.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok, eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.34,0:39:53.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.46,0:39:55.46,general text,,0,0,0,,You bought it again, I can’t believe it
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.43,0:40:01.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Come on again
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.72,0:40:04.18,general text,,0,0,0,,From this distance?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.26,0:40:05.85,general text,,0,0,0,,- Seriously?\N- Come on
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.56,0:40:11.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.94,0:40:15.11,general text,,0,0,0,,the blue mark is visible in the eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.98,0:40:17.32,general text,,0,0,0,,And it’s very beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.20,0:40:24.78,general text,,0,0,0,,And you better not provoke me by being so close
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.45,0:40:26.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Think that I can
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.83,0:40:28.25,general text,,0,0,0,,from this distance
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.50,0:40:34.50,general text,,0,0,0,,I think you understood my words correctly
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.38,0:40:37.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe there is something I can teach you
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.97,0:40:43.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Chang Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.39,0:40:50.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think I’m naive if I lived here alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.52,0:40:52.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, yes
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.77,0:40:57.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I want you to know that I can teach you a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.99,0:41:00.11,general text,,0,0,0,,For example?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.24,0:41:08.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey! You...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.62,0:41:10.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Truly effective attacks are
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.87,0:41:14.00,general text,,0,0,0,,when the enemy is not expecting it at all
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.54,0:41:16.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Remember this, my student
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.59,0:41:21.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I barely touched you, and you gave it your all!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.13,0:41:22.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.43,0:41:26.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.98,0:41:38.78,italics,,0,0,0,,New concubine?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.61,0:41:42.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Now he doesn’t even follow the formalities
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.32,0:41:45.57,italics,,0,0,0,,She is from a small family of magicians in the east
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.66,0:41:48.91,italics,,0,0,0,,On her birthday, a comet streaked past the Big Dipper
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.99,0:41:52.71,general text,,0,0,0,,So he will gather all the women born on unusual nights
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.79,0:41:55.42,italics,,0,0,0,,He wants to catch the King's star
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.43,0:42:08.35,general text,,0,0,0,,When the late king ascended the throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.43,0:42:12.64,general text,,0,0,0,,it was predicted that the next one would be born under the star of the King
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.77,0:42:16.52,general text,,0,0,0,,The people of Deho were happy
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.60,0:42:17.48,general text,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.56,0:42:20.69,general text,,0,0,0,,the throne was taken by your father, born on an ordinary night
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.78,0:42:22.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, like you
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.36,0:42:24.90,general text,,0,0,0,,So the conversations started
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.78,0:42:27.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Prediction is incorrect
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.70,0:42:31.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwangju Chang Gang escaped after making such a funny prediction
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.49,0:42:33.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Your father believes in him
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.12,0:42:35.87,general text,,0,0,0,,So you are afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.33,0:42:39.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.88,0:42:42.67,general text,,0,0,0,,You are afraid that someone with such energy will appear,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.76,0:42:44.92,general text,,0,0,0,,or that your father will have a son
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.80,0:42:47.64,italics,,0,0,0,,I know that
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.06,0:42:53.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Your fight with Chan Wook is just around the corner
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.89,0:42:57.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Destroy the son of the one who made this prediction
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.86,0:43:01.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Get rid of your fears now that you have the opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.28,0:43:05.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.32,0:43:07.78,general text,,0,0,0,,will it appear?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.78,0:43:09.87,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard he was running
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.78,0:43:14.25,general text,,0,0,0,,There are rumors that he is even ready to get married, just not to fight
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.41,0:43:16.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.79,0:43:20.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard he will join the Jin family to use their family amulet
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.13,0:43:29.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Are Wook and Jo Young getting married?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.93,0:43:31.76,general text,,0,0,0,,They broke off their engagement once
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.68,0:43:34.64,general text,,0,0,0,,So it’s easier to prepare for the wedding
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.43,0:43:38.64,general text,,0,0,0,,She still has wedding gifts
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.73,0:43:40.90,general text,,0,0,0,,from last time
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.94,0:43:45.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.53,0:43:48.40,italics,,0,0,0,,After Chan Wook's wedding...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.49,0:43:51.45,general text,,0,0,0,,That is, my husband will move here
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.95,0:43:54.45,general text,,0,0,0,,But my room is too small for the two of us
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.54,0:43:59.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Can we use the big room in the east wing?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.58,0:44:02.34,general text,,0,0,0,,This is your sister's room
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.84,0:44:06.38,general text,,0,0,0,,This is our best room
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.46,0:44:09.51,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s such a pity to keep it empty for so many years
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.51,0:44:11.97,general text,,0,0,0,,It is not empty
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.68,0:44:14.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Boo Young will return
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.81,0:44:17.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry, mother
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.31,0:44:22.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Your father is looking for her
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.36,0:44:26.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Your sister will be coming home soon
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.86,0:44:31.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Bring me the jade Yin-and-Yang from Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.66,0:44:34.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Yin-and-Yang?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.03,0:44:36.41,general text,,0,0,0,,You wanted him
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.95,0:44:41.00,general text,,0,0,0,,They say that if a couple wears rings made of such jade,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.08,0:44:42.79,general text,,0,0,0,,love will only grow stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.92,0:44:47.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Let them make rings from it
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.34,0:44:51.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you, mom
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.62,0:45:16.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Annoying urn. Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.49,0:45:19.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Infuriating
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.00,0:45:27.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I think you're angry,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.34,0:45:29.42,general text,,0,0,0,,that I’m getting married
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.51,0:45:30.55,general text,,0,0,0,,You'll see
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.63,0:45:32.22,general text,,0,0,0,,You will be angrier,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.30,0:45:34.05,general text,,0,0,0,,when I put on this jade ring
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.36,0:45:47.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Eat
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.94,0:45:50.23,general text,,0,0,0,,So
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.61,0:45:55.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I brought a pheasant
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.20,0:45:57.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is there only greenery here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.24,0:45:58.66,general text,,0,0,0,,He's there...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.33,0:46:00.24,general text,,0,0,0,,He's in the soup
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.33,0:46:02.08,general text,,0,0,0,,The pheasant was so small
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.16,0:46:03.92,general text,,0,0,0,,There was very little left when I prepared the broth
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.84,0:46:16.93,general text,,0,0,0,,The taste is very weak
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.93,0:46:24.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard something while selling herbs in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.81,0:46:27.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Two noble families marry their children
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.77,0:46:29.69,general text,,0,0,0,,And who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.77,0:46:32.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Mistress Jin’s daughter is getting married
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.40,0:46:36.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Has Young found herself a groom? Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.53,0:46:38.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Son of Gwangju Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.95,0:46:42.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Isn’t that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.26,0:46:56.47,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t say that I would get married. What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.55,0:46:58.22,general text,,0,0,0,,What is maid Kim doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.30,0:47:01.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Hasty marriages happen due to the appearance of a child
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.14,0:47:02.18,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.77,0:47:04.35,general text,,0,0,0,,You were already engaged
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.02,0:47:06.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe you couldn’t help yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.69,0:47:09.90,general text,,0,0,0,,We have never been so close, how could she get pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.73,0:47:12.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, yes, you’re just so good at talking
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.94,0:47:14.11,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.19,0:47:16.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Then why did you refuse to drink chastity tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.15,0:47:17.15,general text,,0,0,0,,This is because...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.57,0:47:21.24,general text,,0,0,0,,that you need to get married
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.08,0:47:24.83,general text,,0,0,0,,So, I want to get married
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.12,0:47:27.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I would like to
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.75,0:47:28.87,general text,,0,0,0,,I really want to
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.63,0:47:32.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I will definitely get married
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.25,0:47:33.50,general text,,0,0,0,,You'll see
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.73,0:47:50.44,italics,,0,0,0,,Why did you want to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.23,0:47:54.65,general text,,0,0,0,,When will the mother-of-pearl cabinet that I ordered from Sosnovy Bor arrive?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.28,0:47:56.53,general text,,0,0,0,,He is for Uk and me
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.61,0:48:00.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Goods from the south will arrive in a day of the week
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.37,0:48:02.66,general text,,0,0,0,,It's late
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.66,0:48:05.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Should have ordered earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.20,0:48:07.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Forget about the closet
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.62,0:48:09.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I should tell Uku
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.88,0:48:12.21,general text,,0,0,0,,He doesn’t know
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.30,0:48:16.92,general text,,0,0,0,,So I wrote him a letter
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.72,0:48:19.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Read and share your thoughts
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.89,0:48:22.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.72,0:48:26.85,general text,,0,0,0,,It smells
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.93,0:48:29.23,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the incense that carries love
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.14,0:48:31.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Jinyeowon's Treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.36,0:48:35.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Smells very nice
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.80,0:48:59.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you smelling it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.63,0:49:00.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.72,0:49:03.64,general text,,0,0,0,,And close your nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.98,0:49:17.82,general text,,0,0,0,,I almost wasted everything
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.03,0:49:22.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Give the letter to Uku
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.32,0:49:26.53,general text,,0,0,0,,And make sure there is no woman nearby when he opens
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.33,0:49:30.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.50,0:49:36.63,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.71,0:49:41.38,general text,,0,0,0,,You and Uk have the same hands, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.38,0:49:44.59,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.39,0:49:47.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Come with me to buy wedding rings
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.97,0:49:49.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Lend me a hand
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.06,0:49:52.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Why should I go there with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.60,0:49:53.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Go with your fiance
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.81,0:49:58.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Marriage must be concluded by mutual consent
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.57,0:50:02.32,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s sad that you behave this way
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.61,0:50:04.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.03,0:50:07.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think I’m rushing things?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.70,0:50:10.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Or that he will refuse again?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.71,0:50:18.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you in a hurry or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.96,0:50:21.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I will help
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.21,0:50:23.38,general text,,0,0,0,,If only it worked
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.43,0:50:30.18,general text,,0,0,0,,And I’ll lend you a hand too
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.36,0:50:40.94,italics,,0,0,0,,If you think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.03,0:50:43.65,general text,,0,0,0,,maid Kim was against me living with my wife’s family,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.74,0:50:45.82,general text,,0,0,0,,when was the last time we discussed marriage with Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.20,0:50:50.49,general text,,0,0,0,,There is only one reason why they started talking about marriage again
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.99,0:50:52.20,general text,,0,0,0,,My defense
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.79,0:50:55.04,general text,,0,0,0,,She made a deal with the Jin family,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.12,0:50:57.46,general text,,0,0,0,,to help you avoid a fight
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.54,0:50:59.54,general text,,0,0,0,,She probably needed Madam Jin's influence
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.00,0:51:02.63,general text,,0,0,0,,In this case,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.67,0:51:05.09,general text,,0,0,0,,getting married?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.84,0:51:09.85,general text,,0,0,0,,What should I do, teacher? Marry?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.22,0:51:13.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Is it worth it?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.18,0:51:18.90,general text,,0,0,0,,In that case, there is no reason to stay here anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.48,0:51:21.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly. We need to return home
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.48,0:51:23.69,general text,,0,0,0,,But our relationship, of course, will not survive
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.78,0:51:26.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Why? You can still be my maid
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.86,0:51:31.53,general text,,0,0,0,,My plans do not include being her forever
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.76,0:51:51.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Then you will sail on your own
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.47,0:51:52.97,general text,,0,0,0,,I will be in Chwisongru
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.31,0:51:57.39,general text,,0,0,0,,If you don’t come for me, I’ll leave alone
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.12,0:52:13.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Chwisongru
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.33,0:52:20.33,general text,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.42,0:52:22.08,general text,,0,0,0,,We are from Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.17,0:52:24.04,general text,,0,0,0,,We will take you there
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.13,0:52:24.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.38,0:52:30.30,italics,,0,0,0,,This is His Highness’s sachet
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.38,0:52:34.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I am under the protection of the prince himself, you do not dare touch me
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.27,0:52:39.73,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.81,0:52:41.69,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the Crown Prince's sachet
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.70,0:52:55.91,general text,,0,0,0,,We delivered it from Chwisongru
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.54,0:52:58.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Chwisongru?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.13,0:53:09.55,general text,,0,0,0,,The girl you asked has arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.17,0:53:11.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.01,0:53:16.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.43,0:53:19.39,general text,,0,0,0,,She?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.93,0:53:21.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Raise your head
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.07,0:53:34.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.28,0:53:36.78,general text,,0,0,0,,No idea
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.32,0:53:40.53,general text,,0,0,0,,She changed my clothes as soon as they brought me here
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.49,0:53:43.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this your doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.75,0:53:45.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Isn’t she a kisaeng...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.71,0:53:47.96,general text,,0,0,0,,from Chwisongru?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.13,0:53:50.29,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.84,0:53:54.26,general text,,0,0,0,,- She Stink Mu Dok\N- V-Stink?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.34,0:53:57.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Get out
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.51,0:53:59.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Go
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.89,0:54:04.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Just look at yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.35,0:54:10.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you want to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.44,0:54:14.28,general text,,0,0,0,,I wanted to say something, so I ordered you to be delivered
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.36,0:54:16.36,general text,,0,0,0,,But now you are not Won Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.45,0:54:18.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Stink and silk don’t go hand in hand
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.78,0:54:21.37,general text,,0,0,0,,In your dictionary it’s very
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.41,0:54:23.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you just snap?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.87,0:54:25.41,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.50,0:54:28.46,general text,,0,0,0,,I am grateful that they dressed me in silk
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.08,0:54:33.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Acceptable. This new look...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.21,0:54:36.59,general text,,0,0,0,,does not suit you
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.38,0:54:42.85,general text,,0,0,0,,You don’t like it, I’m uncomfortable with this,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.93,0:54:44.18,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll change clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.26,0:54:45.35,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.52,0:54:49.10,general text,,0,0,0,,It doesn’t matter. Leave it as is
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.56,0:54:55.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Say what you want and I’ll do it
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.73,0:54:58.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell your master...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.65,0:54:59.95,general text,,0,0,0,,don’t come that day
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.11,0:55:02.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to kill him
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.53,0:55:05.70,italics,,0,0,0,,and become an enemy of Pine Forest and the Chan family
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.41,0:55:08.71,general text,,0,0,0,,It will be better if he runs away and leaves everything as it is
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.25,0:55:12.71,general text,,0,0,0,,That is, he just needs to remain a laughing stock
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.38,0:55:14.42,italics,,0,0,0,,Correct
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.05,0:55:18.34,general text,,0,0,0,,If he gets stubborn, talk him out of it
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.42,0:55:20.34,general text,,0,0,0,,He won’t survive a fight with me
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.93,0:55:26.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Let him sit quietly and then marry Jin Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.35,0:55:30.44,general text,,0,0,0,,So it’s true that marriage will save his life
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.19,0:55:35.48,general text,,0,0,0,,What will happen to you if he marries?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.57,0:55:36.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Will you stay with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.36,0:55:38.65,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t stay
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.28,0:55:41.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Why? Did he give up on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.37,0:55:47.24,general text,,0,0,0,,And you were ready to drink water from the chamber pot for his sake
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.33,0:55:49.00,italics,,0,0,0,,He has no loyalty,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.08,0:55:50.41,general text,,0,0,0,,no dignity
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.62,0:55:55.84,general text,,0,0,0,,There is something, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.92,0:55:58.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you protecting him? And usually she said nasty things
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.42,0:56:00.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Forgive me
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.17,0:56:03.47,general text,,0,0,0,,You would be pleased to hear nasty things about him,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.30,0:56:08.06,general text,,0,0,0,,but now I don’t have the strength to speak
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.60,0:56:12.23,general text,,0,0,0,,You are a dirty mongrel who will be abandoned by your owner
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.57,0:56:24.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to take it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.74,0:56:27.99,general text,,0,0,0,,I can
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.58,0:56:30.87,general text,,0,0,0,,You will find work here too
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.21,0:56:33.08,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.50,0:56:37.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Let me be Won Mu Deok, whom everyone avoids,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.96,0:56:40.76,general text,,0,0,0,,but I don’t serve everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.26,0:56:46.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Forget. You didn't give up on me either
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.51,0:56:49.56,italics,,0,0,0,,- You can go\N-{\i0} Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.10,0:56:56.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I'll go,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.23,0:56:58.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.03,0:57:09.41,general text,,0,0,0,,"To everyone"?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.74,0:57:12.04,general text,,0,0,0,,I am a prince
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.12,0:57:14.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Won Moo Deok doesn’t understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.21,0:57:15.75,general text,,0,0,0,,whom he is talking to
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.23,0:57:35.98,general text,,0,0,0,,- Be careful. Don't rush\N- Yes, madam
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.11,0:57:38.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.36,0:57:41.23,general text,,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.48,0:57:43.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Young Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.19,0:57:45.70,general text,,0,0,0,,My dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.70,0:57:49.57,general text,,0,0,0,,- Young Master!\N- Were you worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.66,0:57:50.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you eat well?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.95,0:57:52.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, good
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.66,0:57:54.12,general text,,0,0,0,,What happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.20,0:57:55.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Your skin is glowing
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.79,0:57:56.92,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.00,0:57:58.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go inside
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.96,0:58:03.80,general text,,0,0,0,,She was trying to sell it
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.47,0:58:07.84,general text,,0,0,0,,amulet from Sosnovy Bor?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.77,0:58:17.85,general text,,0,0,0,,It wasn’t me. It's all Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.65,0:58:20.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok tried to sell Wook’s amulet?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.94,0:58:23.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I just introduced her to the seller
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.28,0:58:25.28,general text,,0,0,0,,In the end, Ah Hyang stole it
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.36,0:58:27.32,general text,,0,0,0,,So Moo Deok and I have nothing to do with it
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.05,0:58:46.34,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.72,0:58:49.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is she dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.72,0:58:52.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Long story
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.51,0:58:55.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you returned to Chwisong-ra?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.14,0:58:58.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Did Uk sell you back because he’s getting married?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.48,0:58:59.77,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.85,0:59:03.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Even if it sells, I won’t come back here
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.86,0:59:05.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Joo Wol finally gave up and told me,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.94,0:59:07.65,general text,,0,0,0,,that you tried to sell Uka’s amulet
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.99,0:59:12.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I tried
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.70,0:59:14.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.74,0:59:17.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Because I needed money
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.58,0:59:20.29,general text,,0,0,0,,I wanted to wear silks, eat sweets,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.37,0:59:22.88,general text,,0,0,0,,and have fun in such places
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.96,0:59:26.46,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s why you got drunk last time
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.38,0:59:30.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. I stole my owner's money and got drunk
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.22,0:59:37.27,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm really puzzled
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.98,0:59:41.48,general text,,0,0,0,,I just don’t understand you
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.90,0:59:47.19,general text,,0,0,0,,And you don’t need it
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.28,0:59:49.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Leave everything as it is
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.15,0:59:52.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m coming in
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.86,0:59:54.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to join me?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.33,0:59:56.24,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.49,0:59:58.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Goodbye
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.80,1:00:13.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Amulet...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.64,1:00:17.81,general text,,0,0,0,,So it’s you, Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.94,1:00:29.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.86,1:00:32.86,general text,,0,0,0,,why don’t you want to get married?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.70,1:00:36.24,general text,,0,0,0,,You don’t like Mrs. Jin?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.32,1:00:38.66,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s not that I don’t like her
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.70,1:00:41.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm just not interested
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.21,1:00:44.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you like someone else?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.71,1:00:46.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.50,1:00:49.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Do I know her?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.01,1:00:52.05,general text,,0,0,0,,No, you don’t know her
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.63,1:00:53.84,general text,,0,0,0,,So there is someone
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.93,1:00:55.18,general text,,0,0,0,,I knew it
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.26,1:00:56.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.85,1:00:58.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.97,1:01:01.89,general text,,0,0,0,,She is like a lonely egg in a nest not at the top of a tree
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.52,1:01:06.06,general text,,0,0,0,,She has no one but me, so how can I marry someone else?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.15,1:01:09.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Such girls are the most dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.15,1:01:11.40,general text,,0,0,0,,They have nothing to brag about, but they will stick tightly!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.48,1:01:12.99,general text,,0,0,0,,She’s not like that
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.07,1:01:15.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Who is she? Speak
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.61,1:01:16.91,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of her
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.99,1:01:18.16,general text,,0,0,0,,How exactly?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.24,1:01:20.70,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll give her a bag of money,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.79,1:01:23.37,general text,,0,0,0,,she will hatch from the egg and fly away
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.46,1:01:26.88,general text,,0,0,0,,She can’t fly away, it’s not that simple
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.17,1:01:30.30,general text,,0,0,0,,In any case, I can’t get married
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.38,1:01:31.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Deal with it
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.55,1:01:34.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Just figure it out. Fine?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.51,1:01:36.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.35,1:01:42.06,general text,,0,0,0,,What is it? Are you injured?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.14,1:01:43.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Show
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.56,1:01:47.48,general text,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with the hand?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.27,1:01:50.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Uncontrolled again?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.16,1:01:59.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Sell this dress
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.87,1:02:03.50,general text,,0,0,0,,- It’s silk, sell it at a higher price\N- Good
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.08,1:02:06.54,general text,,0,0,0,,The lady now has a visitor
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.62,1:02:08.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Young Miss Jin from Jinyeowon is here
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.08,1:02:12.63,italics,,0,0,0,,She is looking for a master who will make wedding rings for her
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.71,1:02:14.55,general text,,0,0,0,,She marries the magician from Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.51,1:02:20.76,general text,,0,0,0,,How do you like this ring?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.77,1:02:27.48,general text,,0,0,0,,These are the works of the best artisan from Deho
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.27,1:02:32.15,general text,,0,0,0,,They are beautiful, but a little tasteless
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.78,1:02:36.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Can I take a look at the yin-yang jade?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.11,1:02:38.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Having seen it myself, I can choose better options
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.62,1:02:45.62,general text,,0,0,0,,They say when lovers wear jade rings,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.70,1:02:48.21,general text,,0,0,0,,their love grows stronger
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.43,1:03:04.14,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Why did the jade crack?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.97,1:03:07.35,voiceover,,0,0,0,,When I took it, everything was fine
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.15,1:03:15.86,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Did he break down then?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.86,1:03:19.95,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.62,1:03:27.87,italics,,0,0,0,,Ms.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.46,1:03:30.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you leaving suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.83,1:03:33.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this Moo Dok? Uk is here too?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.00,1:03:35.21,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.55,1:03:39.17,general text,,0,0,0,,- Is that so?\N- She follows him with her tail,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.26,1:03:41.05,general text,,0,0,0,,he must be somewhere in the city
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.13,1:03:42.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Walks with its tail?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.01,1:03:44.72,general text,,0,0,0,,She is his servant!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.85,1:03:47.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Watch your language
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.73,1:03:52.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok is not just a servant for him
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.48,1:03:56.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok got drunk recently, and he came for her
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.61,1:03:59.40,italics,,0,0,0,,He dotes on her
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.49,1:04:01.99,general text,,0,0,0,,I just carried it on my back
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.66,1:04:03.57,italics,,0,0,0,,Surely
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.66,1:04:07.37,general text,,0,0,0,,took it from here because I liked it
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.91,1:04:11.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok from here? Was she a gisaeng?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.29,1:04:12.75,general text,,0,0,0,,She's a poor girl
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.42,1:04:16.71,general text,,0,0,0,,No wonder he’s fussing over her so much
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.06,1:04:32.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.73,1:04:34.52,general text,,0,0,0,,You know who I am, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.90,1:04:38.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.11,1:04:40.57,general text,,0,0,0,,You are young Miss Jin from Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.57,1:04:45.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Soon you will call me mistress
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.91,1:04:50.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Because Uk and I are getting married
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.12,1:04:54.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Congratulations
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.92,1:04:58.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I will be his wife, and you will be my maid
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.55,1:05:01.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Do something right now
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.34,1:05:05.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Take the box
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.09,1:05:07.72,general text,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.56,1:05:15.85,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.02,1:05:18.69,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Broken stone
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.28,1:05:23.70,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a valuable thing
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.78,1:05:25.91,general text,,0,0,0,,If it breaks,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.99,1:05:28.03,general text,,0,0,0,,you will be to blame
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.16,1:05:31.83,voiceover,,0,0,0,,You say this when he’s already broken
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.75,1:05:33.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Take it and follow me
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.04,1:05:36.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Ms.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.92,1:05:38.75,general text,,0,0,0,,While I do not serve you
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.38,1:05:42.09,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s time for me to go to my master. Goodbye
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.38,1:05:48.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Is she looking down on me?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.69,1:05:59.23,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t imagine it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.82,1:06:12.20,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,It’s better for me not to cross paths with him
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.33,1:06:16.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey! You!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.46,1:06:19.38,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Dangerous man
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.21,1:06:22.67,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,or is this vile brat?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.26,1:06:25.34,general text,,0,0,0,,My lady
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.13,1:06:28.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Give it to me. I'll carry
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.72,1:06:32.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.93,1:06:35.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Be careful
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.06,1:06:41.56,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Yes, it’s already broken
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.15,1:06:44.36,voiceover,,0,0,0,,She wants to blame me for this?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.26,1:07:15.26,voiceover,,0,0,0,,So this means the Jin family lives here?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.05,1:07:49.51,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.77,1:08:02.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.50,1:08:26.13,italics,,0,0,0,,You can’t just leave
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.42,1:08:30.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Swear in front of the portrait of your late mother that you will marry
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.88,1:08:33.43,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the only way to protect your father's status
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.85,1:08:37.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.26,1:08:38.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.52,1:08:41.64,general text,,0,0,0,,that he is my father?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.19,1:08:46.56,general text,,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.86,1:08:49.53,general text,,0,0,0,,who is my real father?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.19,1:08:52.86,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.78,1:08:55.99,general text,,0,0,0,,You are the son of Gwangju Chang Gang
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.91,1:09:00.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, that’s what I believed all my life
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.20,1:09:02.04,italics,,0,0,0,,I don't want to deny it now
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.12,1:09:03.08,italics,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.17,1:09:07.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I will not sit idly by
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.63,1:09:10.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t stop me,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.13,1:09:12.47,general text,,0,0,0,,whatever I do
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.47,1:09:23.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim, the Jin family sent something
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.19,1:09:26.52,general text,,0,0,0,,From Jinyeowon? What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.60,1:09:28.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Something happened there
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.94,1:09:32.03,general text,,0,0,0,,They want Young Master Chan to hurry to them
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.90,1:10:14.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Were you looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.28,1:10:15.57,general text,,0,0,0,,What does this all mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.15,1:10:18.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Our family heirloom has disappeared
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.66,1:10:20.78,general text,,0,0,0,,And the maid...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.12,1:10:24.25,general text,,0,0,0,,disappeared with her
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.59,1:10:34.34,voiceover,,0,0,0,,That's what he is, Jinyoewon
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.81,1:10:43.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.15,1:10:52.65,general text,,0,0,0,,So it’s you
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.78,1:10:58.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Long time no see
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.64,1:11:29.94,italics,,0,0,0,,You say Mu Dok...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.81,1:11:33.48,general text,,0,0,0,,- missing here?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.07,1:11:35.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Your maid, Moo Deok,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.19,1:11:38.61,general text,,0,0,0,,stole the yin-yang jade and ran away
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.81,1:12:13.10,preview,,0,0,0,,You were thinking about me, Your Highness,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.19,1:12:14.65,preview,,0,0,0,,that's why I came
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.73,1:12:17.36,preview,,0,0,0,,You missed the one you met in Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.44,1:12:18.78,preview,,0,0,0,,Have I missed you?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.86,1:12:20.11,preview,,0,0,0,,There was no such thing
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.19,1:12:21.45,preview,,0,0,0,,Open the door
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.53,1:12:24.49,preview,,0,0,0,,Open the door to Jinyeowon, where the relics are kept
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.57,1:12:26.66,preview,,0,0,0,,You may be possessed by witchcraft and not be able to return
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.74,1:12:28.49,preview,,0,0,0,,You're too afraid to even touch them
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.00,1:12:31.25,preview,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.33,1:12:32.92,preview,,0,0,0,,Bring Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.00,1:12:35.08,preview,,0,0,0,,I must give you up to live
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.17,1:12:36.13,preview,,0,0,0,,This is how it should be
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.34,1:12:39.88,preview,,0,0,0,,So Moo Deok was Nak Soo
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.01,1:12:45.26,preview,,0,0,0,,Fight like your life depends on it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.07,0:20:55.07,general text,,0,0,0,,

Comment: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:47.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Beta editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Sana
